      "source": [
        "# Generic function\n",
        "\n",
        "A generic function is composed of multiple implementations selected by a dispatch rule. For example, `functools.singledispatch` chooses an implementation based on the first argument's type.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-generic-function)"
      ]
    }
